{"type":"message","id":"711457d0","parentId":"6c78a3eb","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:00:30.168Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The \"未找到\" in query_price.py is at line 71 - it means \"no matching coin found\". This would show up when the coin filter doesn't match any coins. \n\nBut 老公 is replying to an Interactive Card, saying \"未找到是什么意思\". The card he's referring to could be:\n1. The price card I pushed - but that one pushed successfully with [PUSH] OK\n2. Some other card from the monitor system\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the context - the replied message body is just \"[Interactive Card]\" which is how Feishu represents card messages in the reply context. It could be from the price card, or it could be from an earlier card.\n\nThe \"未找到\" message means exactly what it says - \"not found\". In the context of query_price.py, it means the coin name filter didn't match any of the tracked coins (BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP).\n\nI should tell him simply that \"未找到\" means the system couldn't find the matching coin - if he tried to filter by a coin name that's not in the tracked list, it would show this. The tracked coins are BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB, DOT, LINK, XRP.\n\nKeep it brief and natural as per SOUL.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"就是查不到对应币种的意思。可能你输入的币种名不在监控列表里，我们目前只追踪 BTC、ETH、SOL、BNB、DOT、LINK、XRP 这七个。你用其他的名字就查不到了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":142,"output":597,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22499,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780444823217}}
