303 algoId=1000000094339392\n2026-06-03 07:53:11 [INFO] SL 触发 DOT，止损移除\n2026-06-03 07:53:26 [INFO] SL 触发 ETH，止损移除\n2026-06-03 07:53:54 [INFO] SL 触发 LINK，止损移除\n2026-06-03 08:01:00 [WARNING] ⚠️ DOT 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{'code': -2021, 'msg': 'Order would immediately trigger.'}\n2026-06-03 08:01:01 [INFO] 📌 DOT 止盈 Algo 单已提交：1.1627 algoId=1000000094344256\n2026-06-03 08:01:03 [WARNING] ⚠️ ETH 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{'code': -2021, 'msg': 'Order would immediately trigger.'}\n2026-06-03 08:01:04 [INFO] 📌 ETH 止盈 Algo 单已提交：2084.3542 algoId=1000000094344310\n2026-06-03 08:01:06 [INFO] 📌 XRP 止损 Algo 单已提交：1.3025 algoId=1000000094344339\n2026-06-03 08:01:07 [WARNING] ⚠️ XRP 止盈 Algo 单提交失败：{'code': -2021, 'msg': 'Order would immediately trigger.'}\n2026-06-03 08:01:09 [WARNING] ⚠️ LINK 止损 Algo 单提交失败：{'code': -2021, 'msg': 'Order would immediately trigger.'}\n2026-06-03 08:01:10 [INFO] 📌 LINK 止盈 Algo 单已提交：9.0303 algoId=1000000094344388\n2026-06-03 08:01:23 [INFO] SL 触发 DOT，止损移除\n2026-06-03 08:01:38 [INFO] SL 触发 ETH，止损移除\n2026-06-03 08:02:06 [INFO] SL 触发 LINK，止损移除","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780445152289}}
{"type":"message","id":"0c98827a","parentId":"c6b035c6","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:06:09.479Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the situation clearly. Let me analyze:\n\nThe monitor is trying to set both TP and SL for all 4 positions, but there are systematic issues:\n\n**Take Profit (止盈) - All 4 have TP orders set:**\n- DOT: TP $1.1627 ✅\n- ETH: TP $2084.35 ✅\n- XRP: TP fails with \"Order would immediately trigger\" ⚠️ (because current price is already above/below TP level, the TP order would trigger instantly)\n- LINK: TP $9.0303 ✅\n\n**Stop Loss (止损):**\n- DOT: SL fails \"Order would immediately trigger\" - and then 15 seconds later \"SL 触发 DOT，止损移除\" (DOT stop triggered, SL removed) - which means the price was already below SL, so when the SL was finally placed, it immediately triggered and closed. But DOT is still in the position... so it seems like what happens is the SL order gets submitted, immediately triggers, and the Algo order is removed, leaving the position without SL protection.\n- ETH: Same pattern - SL fails to submit, then 15 seconds later \"SL 触发 ETH，止损移除\"\n- XRP: SL $1.3025 ✅\n- LINK: Same as DOT/ETH - SL fails, then \"SL 触发 LINK，止损移除\"\n\nSo the reality is:\n- **DOT**: TP $1.1627 ✅ | SL: set but immediately triggered/removed ❌ (no SL protection)\n- **ETH**: TP $2084.35 ✅ | SL: set but immediately triggered/removed ❌ (no SL protection)  \n- **XRP**: TP: fails to submit ❌ | SL $1.3025 ✅ (this one is SHORT, so TP and SL are reversed - TP for short is lower, SL is higher)\n- **LINK**: TP $9.0303 ✅ | SL: set but immediately triggered/removed ❌ (no SL protection)\n\nWait, XRP is a SHORT position. For a short:\n- TP: price goes down → XRP TP at $1.226 (from the positions output)\n- SL: price goes up → XRP SL at $1.3025\n\nSo XRP's TP fails because price ($1.216) is already below the TP level, meaning the TP would trigger immediately. And XRP has SL at $1.3025 set successfully.\n\nThe issue is that DOT, ETH, and LINK all have their SL prices too close to the current market price, so when the Algo order is submitted, Binance rejects it with \"Order would immediately trigger.\" The code tries, gets the rejection, and the position is left without SL protection.\n\nThis is a systematic problem - the SL calculations are too tight relative to current prices.\n\nLet me present this clearly to 老公.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"有是有，但问题不小。从日志看：\n\n**止盈（✅ 已设）**\n- DOT → $1.1627\n- ETH → $2084.35\n- LINK → $9.0303\n- XRP → 提交失败（价格已越过止盈位，立即触发被拒）\n\n**止损（⚠️ 三个有问题）**\n- XRP → $1.3025 ✅ 唯一正常\n- DOT、ETH、LINK → 止损价离现价太近，提交时报 \"Order would immediately trigger\"，Binance 拒绝下单。然后每轮循环都看到「SL 触发 X，止损移除」——就是止损刚挂上就立刻被触发移除，等于 **这三个币实际上没有止损保护**。\n\n问题根源是止损计算偏紧，价格稍微一波动就被判为\"立即触发\"。老公，要不要我调一下止损算法，把安全间距放宽一点？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1214,"output":1393,"cacheRead":24832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27439,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780445152302}}
