{"type":"message","id":"5f688697","parentId":"5d7e4fba","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:13:30.634Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公想让我先列个计划，说明要改哪些文件、改什么。让我整理清楚。\n\n涉及的修改：\n\n1. **crypto_signal_monitor.py** - 核心修改\n   - `compute_tp_sl()` 函数：修改止损计算逻辑，从固定百分比改为 ATR 动态 + 当前价保护\n   - `check_exits_fast()` 相关：修复平仓失败时仍然删除本地持仓的 bug\n   - 可能还需要看 `submit_initial_algo_orders()` 和 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()` 是否受影响\n\n2. 可能还涉及 **binance_auto_trade.py** —— 需要看一下 close_position 用的 place_order 是不是在这个文件\n\n3. **auto_trade_config.json** —— 如果配置需要调整\n\n让我先确认下 `compute_tp_sl` 函数完整内容，以及 ATR 数据来源。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_E85O8uoJd6lfojwdfHxa8000","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","offset":570,"limit":35}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_ZoHy8yOL8dSOS8VQMneI4874","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n 'def place_order\\|def format_quantity\\|def cancel_algo\\|def place_algo' ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py | head -10","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2593,"output":572,"cacheRead":34688,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37853,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780445603946}}
{"type":"message","id":"d348b34f","parentId":"5f688697","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:13:30.788Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_E85O8uoJd6lfojwdfHxa8000","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n    \n    2026-03-28 老公指示：固定百分比止盈止损 + 全平\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：-2%\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    STOP_LOSS_PCT   = 0.02  # 2%\n    \n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做多 +4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做多 -2%\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)  # 做空 -4%\n        sl  = entry * (1 + STOP_LOSS_PCT)    # 做空 +2%\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n        \"sl_price\":  round(sl, 4),\n        \"peak_pnl\":  0.0,   # 移动止盈用\n    }\n\n\n# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n# 七、止盈止损检查（15秒必跑，极轻量）\n\n[1935 more lines in file. Use offset=605 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780445610780}}
