{"type":"message","id":"fc0ce2ad","parentId":"047d313d","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:14:19.399Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me look at how the indicator data is structured to see what's available in `price_data` vs `ind`.\n\nThe function `calc_tp_sl` receives:\n- `entry`: entry price\n- `direction`: \"LONG\" or \"SHORT\"\n- `ind`: indicators dict (includes atr, atr_pct, etc.)\n- `price_data`: price data dict\n\nThe `ind` dict includes `atr`, `atr_pct`, and other indicators. This is available at position open time (line 2480), and also at the start when rebuilding positions.\n\nNow let me also look at line 2253 where it rebuilds positions and estimates ATR. This is the sync-from-API path where indicators may not be available.\n\nOK, I have enough to write the plan. Let me lay it out clearly.\n\nKey files:\n1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` - main changes\n   - `calc_tp_sl()`: add ATR-based SL calculation\n   - `check_exits_fast()` / main loop SL trigger: add close success check before removing position\n   - Line ~2253: position rebuild code uses estimated ATR, need to align\n\nNo other files need modification. The config (`auto_trade_config.json`) already has `atr_sl_tiers` configured, they're just not being used by `calc_tp_sl`.\n\nLet me write the plan.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"只看了一个文件，方案很简单：\n\n---\n\n### 要改的文件：1 个\n\n**`scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py`**（改 2 处）\n\n---\n\n### 改动 1：`calc_tp_sl()` 函数（~第 572 行）\n\n**现状：**\n```python\nSTOP_LOSS_PCT = 0.02  # 固定 -2%\nsl = entry * (1 - STOP_LOSS_PCT)\n```\n\n**改为：** 从 `ind` 里取 ATR%，查配置的 `atr_sl_tiers` 得到倍数，算 ATR 止损距离。最终取 `max(entry -2%, entry - ATR×倍数)`，确保正常行情还是 -2%，高波动时自动放宽。\n\n伪逻辑：\n```\natr_pct = ind[\"atr_pct\"]\n# 查 tier: <2% → 1.0x, <4% → 1.5x, ≥4% → 2.0x\nmultiplier = lookup(atr_pct)\nsl_distance = max(0.02, atr_pct * multiplier)   # 保底 2%\nsl = entry * (1 - sl_distance)                    # LONG\n```\n\n影响范围：新开仓和 API 同步重建的持仓都会用新算法，止损立即生效。\n\n---\n\n### 改动 2：SL 触发后的平仓逻辑（~第 2295 行）\n\n**现状：** 平仓不管成败直接删本地持仓\n\n**改为：** 平仓成功才删，失败保留并打 ERROR 日志\n\n```python\n# 改前：\npositions.remove(pos)     # 不管成败都删\nsave_positions(positions)\n\n# 改后：\nif close_result and close_result.get('success', True):\n    positions.remove(pos)\n    save_positions(positions)\nelse:\n    log.error(\"SL 平仓失败，保留本地持仓等下次重试\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### 不改的文件\n\n- `auto_trade_config.json` — `atr_sl_tiers` 已经配好了，直接用\n- `binance_auto_trade.py` — 不改，`calc_tp_sl` 用的都是现有数据\n- 移动止盈 `update_trailing_stop()` — 不动，它用的是 `pos[\"sl_price\"]`，改了 `calc_tp_sl` 后自动生效\n\n---\n\n就这两个改动，改完需要 `kj` 重启 monitor 生效。要我现在动手吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":774,"output":1155,"cacheRead":40832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42761,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780445642078}}
