{"type":"message","id":"4e283646","parentId":"86371318","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:18:31.112Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_YfQpUJKblHnZTk0ywyde7352","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                    sym_closed = pos['symbol']\n                    positions.remove(pos)\n                    save_positions(positions)\n                    log.info(f\"SL 触发 {sym_closed}，止损移除\")\n                    try:\n                        api_positions = get_all_positions()\n                        api_still_there = any(\n                            float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0 and p.get('symbol', '') == sym_closed\n                            for p in (api_positions or [])\n                        )\n                        if api_still_there:\n                            log.error(f\"⛔ SL 平仓 {sym_closed} 未成交！Binance 仓位仍在，恢复本地缓存\")\n                            # 从 API 重建该币种持仓\n                            for ap in api_positions:\n                                amt = float(ap.get('amount', 0))\n                                if amt != 0 and ap.get('symbol', '') == sym_closed:\n                                    entry = float(ap.get('entry_price', 0))\n                                    typ = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                                    old = pos\n                                    positions.append({\n                                        'symbol': sym_closed,\n                                        'type': typ,\n                                        'entry_price': entry,\n                                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                                        'tp1_price': old.get('tp1_price', 0),\n                                        'sl_price': old.get('sl_price', 0),\n                                        'tp1_hit': old.get('tp1_hit', False),\n                                        'size_remaining': old.get('size_remaining', 1.0),\n                                    })\n                                    save_positions(positions)\n                                    log.warning(f\"🔄 已恢复本地持仓 {sym_closed}（Binance 上仓位未被平掉）\")\n                                    break\n                        else:\n                            api_count = sum(1 for p in api_positions if float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0)\n                            if api_count == 0:\n                                positions = []\n                                save_positions(positions)\n                                log.info(\"📊 SL 平仓后同步：API 持仓为 0，清空本地缓存\")\n                            else:\n                                log.info(f\"📊 SL 平仓后同步：API 还有{api_count}个持仓，保留本地缓存\")\n                    except Exception as e:\n                        log.error(f\"⚠️ SL 平仓后同步失败：{e}\")\n\n[226 more lines in file. Use offset=2352 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780445911093}}
{"type":"message","id":"7dd314cc","parentId":"4e283646","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:18:34.483Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The code looks correct now. The structure:\n\n1. If `api_still_there` (SL close failed, position still on Binance): restore position to local cache\n2. Else (SL close succeeded): check api_count, log appropriately\n\nLet me also verify the calc_tp_sl change.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_n4OXRPWsDRLt4Wtpf6Mg1270","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":570,"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":529,"output":218,"cacheRead":55552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56299,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780445911130}}
{"type":"message","id":"6ad42597","parentId":"7dd314cc","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:18:34.659Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_n4OXRPWsDRLt4Wtpf6Mg1270","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\ndef calc_tp_sl(\n    entry: float,\n    direction: str,\n    ind: dict,\n    price_data: dict,\n) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    返回 {tp1, sl}\n\n    2026-06-03 老公指示：止损改为 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底\n    - 止盈：+4%（TP1 全平 100%）\n    - 止损：max(2%, ATR% × 分层倍数)，防止止损价被行情轻易打穿\n      atr_sl_tiers: <2%ATR→1.0x, <4%→1.5x, ≥4%→2.0x\n    - 无 TP2（已废弃）\n    \"\"\"\n    TAKE_PROFIT_PCT = 0.04  # 2026-03-30 老公指示：改回 4%（8U）\n    MIN_SL_PCT      = 0.02  # 保底 2%\n\n    # ── ATR 动态止损距离 ──\n    atr_pct = ind.get(\"atr_pct\", 0) if ind else 0\n    atr_mult = 1.0  # 默认 1 倍\n    if atr_pct > 0:\n        atr_tiers = CONFIG.get(\"atr_sl_tiers\", [(0.02, 1.0), (0.04, 1.5), (9999, 2.0)])\n        for threshold, mult in atr_tiers:\n            if atr_pct < threshold:\n                atr_mult = mult\n                break\n    sl_pct = max(MIN_SL_PCT, atr_pct * atr_mult)\n\n    if direction == \"LONG\":\n        tp1 = entry * (1 + TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n        sl  = entry * (1 - sl_pct)\n    else:\n        tp1 = entry * (1 - TAKE_PROFIT_PCT)\n        sl  = entry * (1 + sl_pct)\n\n    return {\n        \"tp1_price\": round(tp1, 4),\n\n[1968 more lines in file. Use offset=610 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780445914605}}
{"type":"message","id":"f1c973e5","parentId":"6ad42597","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:18:40.618Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All three changes are in place and the syntax check passed. Let me summarize:\n\n1. `calc_tp_sl()` ✅ — ATR dynamic SL with 2% floor\n2. SL trigger code ✅ — API verification before removing position, recovery if close failed\n3. Position rebuild code ✅ — uses calc_tp_sl() instead of hardcoded values\n\nDone. Time to tell 老公 it's ready and needs a `kj` restart.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"改完了，语法检查通过 ✅\n\n**改了三处：**\n\n1. `calc_tp_sl()` — 止损从固定 -2% 改成 ATR 动态 + 2% 保底。正常波动还是 -2%，高波动自动放宽\n2. SL 触发代码 — 平仓后先查 Binance API 确认仓位真的没了才删本地；如果还在就恢复本地缓存并报 `⛔` 错误，不再死循环\n3. API 同步重建持仓 — 调统一 `calc_tp_sl` 计算止盈止损，不再硬编码百分比\n\n你回去后跑 `kj` 重启就行 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":537,"output":331,"cacheRead":56192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57060,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780445914683}}
