{"type":"message","id":"e3967978","parentId":"549b2760","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:18:53.773Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问\"总是漏掉止盈止损\"是哪里出问题。从之前的日志分析来看，几个问题：\n\n1. DOT、ETH、LINK 的止损单提交失败（\"Order would immediately trigger\"），然后立即被\"SL 触发\"移除——这个我们已经修了（ATR动态止损）\n2. XRP 的止盈单提交失败（\"Order would immediately trigger\"），因为是空单，价格已经跌穿了止盈位\n3. 还有一些止损/止盈单在提交时就被触发移除\n\n但老公可能指的是另一个问题：某些持仓根本没有止盈止损单挂在币安上。让我查一下当前币安上实际挂着的止盈止损单（Algo orders）。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_icq7PYGroavmBrVLcDE28205","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, os, sys, urllib3, time, hmac, hashlib\nfrom urllib.parse import urlencode\nimport requests\nurllib3.disable_warnings()\n\n# Load API keys\nenv_path = os.path.expanduser('~/.openclaw/workspace/crypto/.env')\nwith open(env_path) as f:\n    for line in f:\n        if line.startswith('BINANCE_API_KEY='):\n            api_key = line.split('=',1)[1].strip()\n        if line.startswith('BINANCE_SECRET_KEY='):\n            secret = line.split('=',1)[1].strip()\n\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nheaders = {'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}\ntimestamp = int(time.time() * 1000)\nparams = {'timestamp': timestamp}\nquery_string = urlencode(params)\nsignature = hmac.new(secret.encode(), query_string.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\nurl = f'{base}/fapi/v1/openOrders?{query_string}&signature={signature}'\nr = requests.get(url, headers=headers, verify=False, proxies={'https':'http://127.0.0.1:7890'})\ndata = r.json()\nif isinstance(data, list) and len(data) == 0:\n    print('⚠️ 当前没有任何挂单（止盈止损单）！')\nelif isinstance(data, dict) and 'code' in data:\n    print(f'API错误: {data}')\nelse:\n    for o in data:\n        print(f\\\"{o.get('symbol','?')} {o.get('side','?')} {o.get('type','?')} price={o.get('stopPrice',o.get('price','?'))} origQty={o.get('origQty','?')} status={o.get('status','?')}\\\")\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":7985,"output":789,"cacheRead":49280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58054,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780445922802}}
