{"type":"message","id":"1b1e0685","parentId":"33e4d0a7","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:33:53.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公让我修复。需要改 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` 和 `submit_initial_algo_orders` 两个函数，以及可能添加一个新的辅助函数来按类型取消 Algo 订单。\n\n让我先完整阅读这两个函数，以及 `cancel_algo_orders` 的完整实现，然后设计修改方案。\n\n计划：\n1. 在 `binance_auto_trade.py` 添加一个新函数 `cancel_algo_orders_by_type(symbol, order_type)` 或修改现有逻辑\n2. 修改 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` 不再全删，而是只取消同类型旧单\n3. 修改 `submit_initial_algo_orders` 同样处理\n\n实际上，更简单的方法是：在 monitor.py 中的 `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` 和 `submit_initial_algo_orders` 函数里，先查现有 Algo 订单，然后只取消需要替换的那个类型。\n\n但这样需要每次多一个 API 调用。更好的方式是：在 binance_auto_trade.py 里加一个函数 `cancel_algo_orders_by_type(symbol, order_type)` 来按类型取消。\n\n不过 DELETE /fapi/v1/algoOpenOrders?symbol=XXX 这个端点会取消所有 Algo 订单，不能按类型过滤。我们需要用 DELETE /fapi/v1/algo/order?algoId=XXX 来逐个取消。\n\n所以步骤是：\n1. GET /fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders?symbol=XXX → 获取当前所有 Algo 订单\n2. 过滤出匹配 order_type 的\n3. DELETE /fapi/v1/algo/order?algoId=XXX → 逐个取消\n\n让我直接在 monitor.py 中修改这两个函数，而不是修改 binance_auto_trade.py，因为逻辑更简单。\n\n等一下，让我重新读一下完整的 sync_stop_loss_to_binance 和 submit_initial_algo_orders。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_OOsY2acd8fuF8dcB7SmD4804","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":708,"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":5908,"output":932,"cacheRead":58880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65720,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780446824632}}
{"type":"message","id":"2858e164","parentId":"1b1e0685","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:33:53.759Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_OOsY2acd8fuF8dcB7SmD4804","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0))\n        else:\n            new_sl = peak_p * (1 + gap)  # 峰值价回撤 gap%\n            if new_sl < pos[\"sl_price\"]:\n                old_sl = pos[\"sl_price\"]\n                pos[\"sl_price\"] = round(new_sl, 4)\n                # 同步到 Binance（取消旧单 + 提交新止损+止盈）\n                sync_stop_loss_to_binance(sym, typ, pos[\"sl_price\"], old_sl, pos.get(\"tp1_price\", 0))\n\ndef sync_stop_loss_to_binance(symbol: str, typ: str, new_sl: float, old_sl: float, tp_price: float = 0):\n    \"\"\"\n    2026-03-31 老公指示：同步止损价到 Binance\n    取消旧止损单 + 提交新止损单和止盈单\n    \"\"\"\n    try:\n        sym_usdt = f\"{symbol}USDT\"\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n        \n        cancel_algo_orders(sym_usdt)\n\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            sym_usdt, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", new_sl\n        )\n\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已更新：{old_sl:.4f} → {new_sl:.4f}\")\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 更新 Binance 止损单失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n        # 重新提交止盈（cancel_algo_orders 取消了所有 Algo 单，需要恢复）\n        if tp_price > 0:\n            tp_side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n            tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n                sym_usdt, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", tp_price\n            )\n            if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n                log.info(f\"📌 {symbol} 止盈 Algo 单已恢复：{tp_price}\")\n            else