{"type":"message","id":"e8e6baa5","parentId":"316f2a53","timestamp":"2026-06-03T00:34:51.667Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Syntax passes. Let me do a final review of the changes to make sure everything is consistent and correct.\n\nLet me quickly check if there are any other callers of `cancel_algo_orders` that might be affected by making the cancel-all functionality unavailable (we're not modifying cancel_algo_orders, just not calling it from sync and submit anymore).\n\nAlso, I should check if `_cancel_algo_by_type` can reference the `request` function from binance_auto_trade. Looking at the imports: `from binance_auto_trade import ... request, ... format_quantity`. Yes, `request` is imported at line 40-49.\n\nGood, everything should work. Let me summarize the changes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"语法通过 ✅\n\n**改了什么：**\n\n1. 新增 `_cancel_algo_by_type()` 辅助函数 — 查币安 Algo 订单，只取消指定类型（STOP_MARKET 或 TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET），不碰另一边\n\n2. `sync_stop_loss_to_binance()` — 原逻辑 `全删→重设止损→重设止盈`，改成 `只删止损→重设止损` + `只删止盈→重设止盈`，两边互不影响\n\n3. `submit_initial_algo_orders()` — 同理，止损止盈分开取消和提交\n\n效果：SL 挂了不影响 TP 还挂在币安上，反之亦然。不会再出现\"锁一边另一边被无辜删掉\"的循环。\n\n你回去跑 `kj` 一起生效 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":134,"output":480,"cacheRead":71040,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":71654,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780446884851}}
