{"type":"message","id":"ad92158f","parentId":"5504abdc","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:17:19.988Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the positions. The positions show that DOT, ETH, LINK are LONG positions and XRP is SHORT. All have proper entry prices.\n\nBut wait - the positions display shows ETH has TP1:$2084 SL:$1964 — this means the new calc_tp_sl with ATR is working! The SL is now $1964 (entry $2004 * (1 - 2%) = $1963.92 ≈ $1964). But this is the same as before (2% floor took effect since ATR might be low). The key issue is that these positions were opened BEFORE the ATR fix, so their stored SL is still the old -2% value.\n\nBut the bigger problem is: ALL positions can't be closed because of \"ReduceOnly Order is rejected\" (-2022).\n\nLet me look at the place_order function to understand how close orders are sent. The key question is: when close_position calls place_order with reduce_only=True, what does the API request look like?\n\nLet me look at the place_order function.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_sYEmYdoApoSXA0nUvhAE9231","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":406,"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/binance_auto_trade.py","limit":70}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":594,"output":526,"cacheRead":78848,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79968,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780456632451}}
{"type":"message","id":"550a3321","parentId":"ad92158f","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:17:20.088Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_sYEmYdoApoSXA0nUvhAE9231","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def place_order(symbol, side, quantity, leverage=10, tp_price=None, sl_price=None, price=0, reduce_only=False):\n    \"\"\"\n    下单\n    \n    Args:\n        symbol: 币种符号 (如 BTCUSDT)\n        side: BUY/SELL\n        quantity: 数量\n        leverage: 杠杆倍数 (默认 10x)\n        tp_price: 止盈价格 (可选)\n        sl_price: 止损价格 (可选)\n        price: 当前价格（用于计算精度）\n        reduce_only: 是否只减仓（平仓时用，不受最低金额限制）\n    \"\"\"\n    # 2026-03-28 老公指示：开仓前先设置逐仓模式\n    if not reduce_only:\n        set_isolated_margin(symbol)\n    \n    # 格式化数量和价格（根据 Binance 精度要求）\n    formatted_quantity = format_quantity(symbol.replace(\"USDT\", \"\"), quantity, price) if price > 0 else quantity\n    formatted_tp = format_price(tp_price) if tp_price else None\n    formatted_sl = format_price(sl_price) if sl_price else None\n    \n    log_order_info(symbol, side, formatted_quantity, price, formatted_tp, formatted_sl, reduce_only)\n    \n    # 1. 设置杠杆（reduce_only 时跳过）\n    if not reduce_only:\n        leverage_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/leverage\", {\n            \"symbol\": symbol,\n            \"leverage\": leverage\n        })\n    else:\n        leverage_result = {\"skipped\": True}\n    \n    # 2. 下单\n    order_params = {\n        \"symbol\": symbol,\n        \"side\": side,\n        \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n        \"quantity\": formatted_quantity,\n        \"reduceOnly\": str(reduce_only).lower()\n    }\n    \n    order_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n    \n    # 主单失败时直接返回，不要再下 SL/TP（避免无主单的孤儿挂单）\n    main_order_ok = isinstance(order_result, dict) and bool(order_result.get(\"orderId\"))\n    if not main_order_ok:\n        log.error(f\"🔴 {symbol} 主单失败，跳过 SL/TP 提交。原始响应：{order_result}\")\n    \n    # 3. 设置止盈止损（Algo Order API，避免 -4120）\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_sl:\n        sl_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        sl_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, sl_side, \"STOP_MARKET\", formatted_sl\n        )\n        if isinstance(sl_result, dict) and sl_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n                f\"📌 {symbol} 止损 Algo 单已提交：{formatted_sl} algoId={sl_result.get('algoId')}\"\n            )\n        else:\n            log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 止损单提交失败：{sl_result}\")\n\n    if main_order_ok and formatted_tp:\n        tp_side = \"SELL\" if side == \"BUY\" else \"BUY\"\n        tp_result = place_algo_conditional_order(\n            symbol, tp_side, \"TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET\", formatted_tp\n        )\n        if isinstance(tp_result, dict) and tp_result.get(\"algoId\"):\n            log.info(\n\n[108 more lines in file. Use offset=476 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780456640077}}
{"type":"message","id":"be05e086","parentId":"550a3321","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:17:38.215Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the problem! When `reduce_only=True`, the code sends a MARKET order:\n\n```python\norder_params = {\n    \"symbol\": symbol,\n    \"side\": side,\n    \"type\": \"MARKET\",\n    \"quantity\": formatted_quantity,\n    \"reduceOnly\": \"true\"\n}\norder_result = request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/order\", order_params)\n```\n\nFor Binance Futures, when you send a MARKET order with `reduceOnly: true`, you need to make sure:\n1. The side matches: LONG position → SELL, SHORT position → BUY\n2. The quantity doesn't exceed the position size\n3. The position actually exists\n\nThe `close_position` function at line 1173 calls `place_order` with `side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"` and `reduce_only=True`.\n\nWait, but I also see from the log:\n```\n📝 下单详情：ETHUSDT 平仓 数量=0.008000 @ $1847.180000\n```\n\n0.008 ETH? That's very small. The position from query_positions showed:\n- ETH: entry $2004, current $1849\n\nWith 20 USDT capital, 10x leverage = 200 USDT nominal. 200 / 2004 = 0.0998 ETH. But the log shows 0.008 ETH. That's way too small.\n\nWait, let me look at the actual order more carefully. The amount in the positions list is `amount=0.008` (from the recovery log `amount=0.008 → 0.008`). But that's not right — 0.008 ETH * $2004 = $16.03, with 10x = $160.3 nominal. Not matching 20 USDT with 10x.\n\nHmm, maybe the position amount on Binance is not what we expect. Let me check the actual Binance position data.\n\nActually, let me focus on the main problem: why is `ReduceOnly Order is rejected` happening for ALL positions?\n\nPossible causes:\n1. The position doesn't exist in Hedge mode (positionSide issue) — Binance Futures has TWO_WAY and ONE_WAY modes. In HEDGE mode (which is the default for USDⓈ-M Futures now), you must specify `positionSide` (LONG or SHORT). If the positions were opened with `positionSide: LONG` but the close order doesn't specify `positionSide`, Binance might reject it.\n2. The quantity is wrong — too small, too large, or doesn't match precision\n\nWait, actually Binance USDⓈ-M Futures by default is in ONE_WAY mode where positionSide doesn't matter. But if the account is in HEDGE mode, all orders need positionSide.\n\nLet me check the account's position mode. Actually, looking at the open positions from before:\n```json\n{\n  \"positionSide\": \"BOTH\",\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nThe Algo orders show `positionSide: \"BOTH\"` which means the account might be in ONE_WAY mode. But the MARKET orders for closing don't include positionSide at all.\n\nHmm, actually the problem might be simpler. Let me look at the query_positions output more carefully:\n\nThe positions show amounts that look correct. But the actual amount from Binance API might be different from what the local cache stores.\n\nLet me look at the actual Binance position data to see the real position amounts.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Vlge5Dyw3dI37VHm1Qs59995","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, os, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request, get_all_positions\n# Get actual positions from Binance\npos = get_all_positions()\nif isinstance(pos, list):\n    for p in pos:\n        amt = float(p.get('positionAmt', 0))\n        if abs(amt) > 0:\n            print(f\\\"{p['symbol']}: positionAmt={amt} entry={p.get('entryPrice','?')} mark={p.get('markPrice','?')} unPnl={p.get('unRealizedProfit','?')} marginType={p.get('marginType','?')}\\\")\nelse:\n    print(json.dumps(pos, indent=2))\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":792,"output":1722,"cacheRead":79744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82258,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"too