{"type":"message","id":"61ddcd64","parentId":"d1f2a6b2","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:18:15.069Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ET_t0jMDc6J1XB9nMiTzi2t8797","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def get_quantity_precision(symbol, price):\n    \"\"\"\n    根据 Binance API 的 stepSize 动态获取数量精度\n    来源：/fapi/v1/exchangeInfo LOT_SIZE.stepSize\n    \"\"\"\n    # 币种精度映射（仅保留当前交易的币种）\n    # 更新：2026-03-28 老公指示：添加 BTC\n    precision_map = {\n        'BTC': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'ETH': 3,      # stepSize: 0.001\n        'SOL': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01\n        'BNB': 2,      # stepSize: 0.01 ✅ 2026-03-28 修复：3→2 位\n        'DOT': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1\n        'LINK': 2,     # stepSize: 0.01\n        'XRP': 1,      # stepSize: 0.1 ✅ 2026-03-31 同步：加回 XRP\n    }\n    \n    return precision_map.get(symbol.upper(), 8)  # 默认 8 位\n\ndef format_quantity(symbol, quantity, price):\n\n[311 more lines in file. Use offset=273 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780456695046}}
{"type":"message","id":"6273c02c","parentId":"61ddcd64","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:18:24.426Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the precision map looks right. Let me now trace through the actual problem to understand why ReduceOnly is rejected.\n\nWait, actually let me re-read the `close_position` function more carefully, specifically what quantity it uses.\n\nFrom the close_position function at line 1173:\n```python\nqty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\nqty = format_quantity(symbol, qty_raw, entry)\n```\n\nAnd from the position data on Binance:\n- ETH: positionAmt = 0.008\n- The local position has `amount: 0.008` (from the recovery log)\n\nSo `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * 1.0 = pos.get(\"qty\", 0)`. But the position dict uses `amount` not `qty`:\n\nLooking at position format (line ~1100):\n```python\n\"amount\": round(qty, 6),\n```\n\nSo `pos.get(\"qty\", 0)` would return 0 because the field is named `amount`, not `qty`!\n\nLet me check again...\n\nActually, let me re-read close_position:\n```python\nqty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\nqty = format_quantity(symbol, qty_raw, entry)\n```\n\nAnd the position has `amount`, not `qty`. So `pos.get(\"qty\", 0)` returns 0. Then `qty_raw = 0 * 1.0 = 0`. Then `format_quantity(\"ETH\", 0, 2004.1867)` = `round(0, 3)` = `0.0`.\n\nBut wait, the log shows:\n```\n📝 下单详情：ETHUSDT 平仓 数量=0.008000 @ $1847.180000\n```\n\nSo quantity is 0.008, not 0.0. How?\n\nLet me re-read close_position more carefully.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_tNGw8qx71iXjPbWez9KZ4150","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1173,"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":50}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":505,"output":935,"cacheRead":84096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85536,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse"