{"type":"message","id":"db95c734","parentId":"19cf3a22","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:20:27.372Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"DOT position is now 0.0. The MARKET SELL without reduceOnly closed the position! \n\nSo the non-reduceOnly MARKET order worked and closed the DOT position. But reduceOnly MARKET orders all get rejected.\n\nThis is definitely a Binance Testnet issue. The reduceOnly parameter is being rejected by the testnet API.\n\nLet me verify: is this a known issue with Binance Testnet?\n\nActually, let me first check all positions now:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ZqFNlCqNyyYxLYES3eRK3983","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 query_positions.py 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":287,"output":269,"cacheRead":90880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91436,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780456821964}}
{"type":"message","id":"d8210ad0","parentId":"db95c734","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:20:32.821Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ZqFNlCqNyyYxLYES3eRK3983","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2026-06-03 11:20:31 [INFO] 🔄 已加载 auto_trade_config.json（API key 前缀：4XOtZh5r...10XU）\n/root/.local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/urllib3/connectionpool.py:1097: InsecureRequestWarning: Unverified HTTPS request is being made to host '127.0.0.1'. Adding certificate verification is strongly advised. See: https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advanced-usage.html#tls-warnings\n  warnings.warn(\n2026-06-03 11:20:32 [INFO] ✅ 从 Binance API 获取 3 个持仓\n[OK] 当前持仓 3 个 (Binance Testnet 实时)\n  💎 ETH LONG   入$2004       现$1846       🔴 -1.26USDT (-7.88%) TP1:$2084 SL:$1964\n  🪙 XRP SHORT  入$1.277      现$1.213      🟢 +8.88USDT (+4.98%)\n  🔗 LINK LONG   入$8.683      现$8.342      🔴 -7.24USDT (-3.93%) TP1:$9.03 SL:$8.509\n\n  浮动盈亏: +0.38 USDT\n  今日已实现: -52.02 USDT\n  ⚠️ 净盈亏: -51.64 USDT"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":5333,"aggregated":"2026-06-03 11:20:31 [INFO] 🔄 已加载 auto_trade_config.json（API key 前缀：4XOtZh5r...10XU）\n/root/.local/lib/python3.13/site-packages/urllib3/connectionpool.py:1097: InsecureRequestWarning: Unverified HTTPS request is being made to host '127.0.0.1'. Adding certificate verification is strongly advised. See: https://urllib3.readthedocs.io/en/latest/advanced-usage.html#tls-warnings\n  warnings.warn(\n2026-06-03 11:20:32 [INFO] ✅ 从 Binance API 获取 3 个持仓\n[OK] 当前持仓 3 个 (Binance Testnet 实时)\n  💎 ETH LONG   入$2004       现$1846       🔴 -1.26USDT (-7.88%) TP1:$2084 SL:$1964\n  🪙 XRP SHORT  入$1.277      现$1.213      🟢 +8.88USDT (+4.98%)\n  🔗 LINK LONG   入$8.683      现$8.342      🔴 -7.24USDT (-3.93%) TP1:$9.03 SL:$8.509\n\n  浮动盈亏: +0.38 USDT\n  今日已实现: -52.02 USDT\n  ⚠️ 净盈亏: -51.64 USDT","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780456832762}}
{"type":"message","id":"d039e3fc","parentId":"d8210ad0","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:20:51.181Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so DOT was successfully closed with a non-reduceOnly MARKET order. Now we have 3 positions left: ETH, XRP, LINK.\n\nThe issue is clear: **Binance Testnet is rejecting ALL reduceOnly orders**. This is a testnet problem, not our code bug.\n\nHowever, we need to fix this. The solution: when close_position receives a reduceOnly rejection, fall back to a regular (non-reduceOnly) MARKET order. But we need to be careful:\n- For LONG positions: SELL MARKET (without reduceOnly) will close the position because it reverses it\n- For SHORT positions: BUY MARKET (without reduceOnly) will close the position\n\nThe risk is that if the position is larger than what we're closing (e.g., closing 50% of a position), a non-reduceOnly order could end up opening a reverse position instead of just reducing. But since our system always closes 100% (size_ratio=1.0), this should be safe.\n\nWait, actually, the check_exits_fast function always returns size_ratio=1.0. And close_position uses `qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio`. So it always closes the full position. A non-reduceOnly MARKET SELL of 0.008 ETH would:\n1. If there's a 0.008 ETH LONG position → close it to 0, then maybe open a 0 SHORT = net 0\n2. The MARKET order amount matches the position exactly, so it should just close\n\nActually the proper way to handle this: for Binance testnet, when reduceOnly gets -2022, retry with `closePosition: true` instead of `reduceOnly: true`. These are different parameters:\n- `reduceOnly: true` + `quantity`: reduces position by specified quantity\n- `closePosition: true`: closes entire position regardless of quantity\n\nBut `closePosition` is for the newer endpoint. Let me think...\n\nActually, the simplest practical fix: in `place_order` or `close_position`, if the order fails with -2022, retry without reduceOnly. Since we always close 100%, this should be safe.\n\nBut first, let me verify my theory for all 3 remaining positions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_iRvDeFqf59ZOa8wG2T1R4749","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request, format_quantity\n\n# Test reduceOnly vs non-reduceOnly on all remaining symbols\nfor sym, qty, side, price in [('ETHUSDT', 0.008, 'SELL', 1846), ('LINKUSDT', 21.23, 'SELL', 8.34), ('XRPUSDT', 139.8, 'BUY', 1.213)]:\n    # reduceOnly first\n    r1 = request('POST', '/fapi/v1/order', {'symbol': sym, 'side': side, 'type': 'MARKET', 'quantity': qty, 'reduceOnly': 'true'})\n    ok1 = isinstance(r1, dict) and not r1.get('code')\n    print(f'{sym} reduceOnly={ok1} {r1.get(\\\"code\\\",\\\"ok\\\") if isinstance(r1,dict) else \\\"?\\\"} {r1.get(\\\"msg\\\",\\\"\\\") if isinstance(r1,dict) else \\\"\\\"}')\n    \n    if not ok1:\n        # Fallback without reduceOnly\n        r2 = request('POST', '/fapi/v1/order', {'symbol': sym, 'side': side, 'type': 'MARKET', 'quantity': qty})\n        ok2 = isinstance(r2, dict) and not r2.get('code')\n        print(f'  → non-reduceOnly={ok2} {r2.get(\\\"code\\\",\\\"ok\\\") if isinstance(r2,dict) else \\\"?\\\"}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":420,"output":1381,"cacheRead":91264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":93065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780456832874}}
