{"type":"message","id":"6c36abfe","parentId":"23ae6843","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:24:40.599Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good - LINK and XRP were also closed during my test (the non-reduceOnly orders worked). Now only ETH remains, and it has the -4164 margin issue.\n\nNow let me modify `close_position` to add the reduceOnly → non-reduceOnly fallback. Let me re-read the exact code to edit.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"只剩 ETH 了（LINK、XRP、DOT 测试时用非 reduceOnly 已经平掉了）。现在改 `close_position`："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_dkSSP3LLGyx4jeCGD2Fx5971","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":55,"offset":1197}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":298,"output":258,"cacheRead":96896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97452,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780457075791}}
{"type":"message","id":"175735ee","parentId":"6c36abfe","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:24:40.650Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_dkSSP3LLGyx4jeCGD2Fx5971","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    return pos\n\n\ndef close_position(pos: dict, reason: str, size_ratio: float, current_price: float):\n    entry = pos[\"entry_price\"]\n    typ   = pos[\"type\"]\n    symbol = pos[\"symbol\"]\n    qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\n    \n    qty = format_quantity(symbol, qty_raw, entry)\n\n    # 实盘平仓调用（使用 place_order with reduce_only=True）\n    # 平仓重试机制（最多 3 次）\n    close_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):  # 2026-03-31 优化：3->5 次\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                # 🐛 Bug 修复：传递 current_price 用于日志显示正确价格\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,  # 2026-03-27 老公指示：3x→10x 测试两天\n                    reduce_only=True,\n                    price=current_price,  # 传递当前价格用于日志\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                # 成功就跳出重试\n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                else:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 2 else '放弃'}\")\n                    if attempt < 4:\n                        time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"❌ 平仓异常第{attempt+1}次：{e}\")\n                close_result = {\"error\": str(e), \"success\": False}\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n\n    # 计算盈亏 - 使用实际持仓数量，不再用标准仓位\n    pnl_pct = (current_price - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - current_price) / entry\n    qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\n    pnl_usdt = qty_raw * entry * pnl_pct  # 实际数量 × 入场价 × 涨跌幅\n    # 2026-03-25 老公指示：用实际成交价计算真实盈亏（API 返回的 realizedPnl 优先）\n    if close_result and close_result.get('success') and close_result.get('order'):\n        realized = close_result.get('order', {}).get('realizedPnl')\n        if realized is not None:\n            pnl_usdt = float(realized)\n\n\n    # 检查平仓是否真正成功\n    close_success = True\n    if close_result:\n\n[1341 more lines in file. Use offset=1252 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780457080639}}
{"type":"message","id":"90ed3d12","parentId":"175735ee","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:24:54.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ET_I0IugjbXvs74QVJQGr0T8325","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","new_string":"    # 实盘平仓调用（使用 place_order with reduce_only=True）\n    # 2026-06-03 修复：币安测试网 reduceOnly 全线返回 -2022，降级为不带 reduceOnly 的平仓\n    close_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                use_reduce_only = True\n                \n                # 🔧 2026-06-03：第一次用 reduceOnly；如果被拒（-2022）则降级不带 reduceOnly\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,\n                    reduce_only=use_reduce_only if attempt == 0 else False,\n                    price=current_price,\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                \n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                \n                # 检查是否是 reduceOnly 被拒\n                order_code = close_result.get('order', {}).get('code', 0)\n                if attempt == 0 and order_code == -2022:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} reduceOnly 被币安拒（-2022），降级为普通平仓\")\n                    time.sleep(1)\n                    close_result = place_order(\n                        symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                        side=side,\n                        quantity=qty,\n                        leverage=10,\n                        reduce_only=False,\n                        price=current_price,\n                    )\n                    log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果（降级）：{close_result}\")\n                    if close_result.get('success', True):\n                        break\n                    else:\n                        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n                else:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n                \n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"❌ 平仓异常第{attempt+1}次：{e}\")\n                close_result = {\"error\": str(e), \"success\": False}\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)","old_string":"    # 实盘平仓调用（使用 place_order with reduce_only=True）\n    # 平仓重试机制（最多 3 次）\n    close_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):  # 2026-03-31 优化：3->5 次\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                # 🐛 Bug 修复：传递 current_price 用于日志显示正确价格\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,  # 2026-03-27 老公指示：3x→10x 测试两天\n                    reduce_only=True,\n                    price=current_price,  # 传递当前价格用于日志\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                # 成功就跳出重试\n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                else:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 2 else '放弃'}\")\n                    if attempt < 4:\n                        time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"❌ 平仓异常第{attempt+1}次：{e}\")\n                close_result = {\"error\": str(e), \"success\": False}\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":761,"output":962,"cacheRead":97280,"cacheWr