{"type":"message","id":"98f34660","parentId":"422d38bb","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:25:15.125Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Syntax passes. Now let me verify the ETH situation. ETH is the only remaining position. It has -4164 (insufficient margin) even with non-reduceOnly. This means:\n\n1. The bot tries reduceOnly → gets -2022 → falls back to non-reduceOnly → gets -4164\n2. The bot retries 5 times (all failing with -4164)\n3. Our earlier fix detects position still on Binance → restores local cache\n4. Cycle repeats but at least doesn't delete-cache-forever\n\nETH needs a different approach. Since the non-reduceOnly close fails due to insufficient margin, we could try:\n- Adding margin to the isolated wallet before closing\n- Or using a different closing strategy\n\nBut that's a separate issue. The main fix for reduceOnly is done. Let me summarize.\n\nActually, wait - the logic flow has an issue. When attempt 0 gets -2022, I immediately try non-reduceOnly as a fallback. But then if that also fails (like with ETH), the code falls through to the `else` branch that logs \"平仓第1次失败，重试\". Then attempts 1-4 will all use non-reduceOnly (based on my code: `use_reduce_only if attempt == 0 else False`). So attempts 2-5 will retry non-reduceOnly which all fail with -4164. That's fine - same behavior as before but with the fallback.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the logic. The fallback happens on attempt 0 but we still increment the attempt counter. So if the fallback also fails, we go to \"平仓第1次失败\" and then attempt 1 will retry with non-reduceOnly. This gives us 1 reduceOnly try + 1 immediate fallback + 4 more retries = 6 total attempts. That's fine.\n\nBut wait, I see a potential issue: the immediate fallback inside attempt=0 doesn't call `time.sleep(2)` before retrying attempt 1. The code says:\n```python\nif attempt == 0 and order_code == -2022:\n    # try non-reduceOnly immediately\n    ...\n    if close_result.get('success', True):\n        break\n    else:\n        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\nelse:\n    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n\nif attempt < 4:\n    time.sleep(2)\n```\n\nWhen the fallback also fails, it logs \"平仓第1次失败\" and then has `if attempt < 4: time.sleep(2)`. Since attempt=0 < 4, it sleeps. Then attempt becomes 1 and the loop tries non-reduceOnly. This is correct.\n\nOK, the code is correct. Let me now tell 老公 it's done and needs another restart.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"语法通过 ✅\n\n改了 `close_position`：第一次用 reduceOnly 下单，如果币安返回 -2022（测试网 reduceOnly 挂了），立刻降级为不带 reduceOnly 的普通 MARKET 平仓。\n\n现在只剩 ETH 一个持仓，但它有额外问题——不带 reduceOnly 也报 -4164（逐仓保证金不够），这个需要单独处理。\n\n你要的话可以再 `kj` 重启，新代码对后续开仓和平仓都有用 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":85,"output":1386,"cacheRead":99072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":100543,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780457098420}}
