{"type":"message","id":"679c9696","parentId":"8aabdbd8","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:29:43.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公要我在平仓前自动补保证金。需要在 close_position 里，当不带 reduceOnly 的平仓失败（-4164）时，先从合约账户往逐仓钱包补充保证金，然后再重试平仓。\n\nBinance API 添加逐仓保证金：\nPOST /fapi/v1/positionMargin\n参数: symbol, amount, type=1 (add)\n\namount 需要计算：当前仓位名义价值 × 0.1（10x杠杆所需的维持保证金）- 当前已用保证金，再加上一些余量。\n\n实际上更简单的：补充足够的保证金使得能开一个反向仓位。ETH 仓位是 0.008 ETH，当前价格 ~$1849，名义价值 = 0.008 × 1849 = $14.79。10x 杠杆需要 $1.48 保证金。当前 isolatedWallet = $1.59，isolatedMargin = $0.35。\n\n对于不带 reduceOnly 的平仓，币安需要的保证金大约是反向仓位所需保证金。0.008 ETH 的空单需要 $1.48 保证金。当前钱包有 $1.59。\n\nWait，$1.59 > $1.48，应该够啊... 但报 -4164 说明不够。\n\n让我重新检查。ETH isolatedWallet=1.59, isolatedMargin=0.35。实际钱包余额 = 1.59 - 0.35 = 1.24 USDT（不，isolatedWallet 就是钱包里的总额）。\n\n问题可能是：不带 reduceOnly 的 SELL 0.008 ETH 会创建新的 SHORT 仓位，需要初始保证金 = 0.008 × 1849 / 10 = $1.48。但钱包只有 $1.59... 等等，$1.59 > $1.48，应该够的。\n\n也许问题是钱包里还需要考虑未实现亏损？或者 Binance 要求的保证金比例不同？\n\n实际上，-4164 可能是另一个原因。让我重新分析。也许不是 margin 不足，而是其他的原因。\n\n让我直接在代码里加一个补保证金的逻辑。当平仓失败时，先补充一些保证金。补充量：计算需要的保证金然后加。\n\n简单做法：在 close_position 中，当非 reduceOnly 平仓失败（-4164）时，补充 5 USDT 到该币种的逐仓钱包，然后重试。\n\n5 USDT 对于测试网来说足够了。\n\n让我找到添加保证金的方法。在 binance_auto_trade.py 里应该有类似的函数，或者我可以直接用 request。\n\nPOST /fapi/v1/positionMargin\n参数: symbol, amount, type=1\n\n让我修改 close_position，在 -4164 失败时补保证金再重试。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_uR0M3IvJFQIT7A7Jo5RE9939","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":1210,"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":55}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":629,"output":1229,"cacheRead":100224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":102082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780457367141}}
{"type":"message","id":"e00287cd","parentId":"679c9696","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:29:43.651Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_uR0M3IvJFQIT7A7Jo5RE9939","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    close_result = None\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                use_reduce_only = True\n                \n                # 🔧 2026-06-03：第一次用 reduceOnly；如果被拒（-2022）则降级不带 reduceOnly\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,\n                    reduce_only=use_reduce_only if attempt == 0 else False,\n                    price=current_price,\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                \n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                \n                # 检查是否是 reduceOnly 被拒\n                order_code = close_result.get('order', {}).get('code', 0)\n                if attempt == 0 and order_code == -2022:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} reduceOnly 被币安拒（-2022），降级为普通平仓\")\n                    time.sleep(1)\n                    close_result = place_order(\n                        symbol=f\"{symbol}USDT\",\n                        side=side,\n                        quantity=qty,\n                        leverage=10,\n                        reduce_only=False,\n                        price=current_price,\n                    )\n                    log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果（降级）：{close_result}\")\n                    if close_result.get('success', True):\n                        break\n                    else:\n                        log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n                else:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n                \n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n                log.error(f\"❌ 平仓异常第{attempt+1}次：{e}\")\n                close_result = {\"error\": str(e), \"success\": False}\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n\n    # 计算盈亏 - 使用实际持仓数量，不再用标准仓位\n    pnl_pct = (current_price - entry) / entry if typ == \"LONG\" else (entry - current_price) / entry\n    qty_raw = pos.get(\"qty\", 0) * size_ratio\n    pnl_usdt = qty_raw * entry * pnl_pct  # 实际数量 × 入场价 × 涨跌幅\n    # 2026-03-25 老公指示：用实际成交价计算真实盈亏（API 返回的 realizedPnl 优先）\n\n[1350 more lines in file. Use offset=1265 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780457383634}}
