{"type":"message","id":"24b3ec83","parentId":"68c6fe6a","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:30:36.952Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! -4164 is not about insufficient margin — it's about **minimum notional value**.\n\n`\"Order's notional must be no smaller than 20 (unless you choose reduce only).\"`\n\nETH: 0.008 × $1849 = $14.79 notional. Binance requires minimum $20 notional for non-reduceOnly orders. So ETH position is too small to close with a regular non-reduceOnly order!\n\nThis means:\n- reduceOnly: rejected by Binance testnet (-2022)\n- non-reduceOnly: rejected because notional < $20 (-4164)\n\nThe fix: when the position is too small for a non-reduceOnly close, we need to either:\n1. Use closePosition: true (closes entire position regardless of quantity)\n2. Or use a LIMIT order with closePosition: true\n3. Or try a different approach\n\nLet me try `closePosition: true` parameter instead of `reduceOnly: true`.\n\nActually, looking at it again, the error says \"unless you choose reduce only\". But reduceOnly on testnet is broken. So we're stuck.\n\nLet me try `closePosition: true`:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_N205ATCpt3pPa07y4mex5215","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport json, sys\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\n\nsym = 'ETHUSDT'\n# Try closePosition: true (not reduceOnly!)\nprint('Attempt: closePosition=true MARKET')\nr = request('POST', '/fapi/v1/order', {\n    'symbol': sym, 'side': 'SELL', 'type': 'MARKET',\n    'closePosition': 'true'\n})\nprint(json.dumps(r, indent=2) if isinstance(r, dict) else r)\n\nimport time\ntime.sleep(1)\nr = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk', {'symbol': sym})\namt = float(r[0]['positionAmt']) if isinstance(r, list) else 0\nprint(f'ETH positionAmt: {amt}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":444,"output":742,"cacheRead":104192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105378,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780457426708}}
