{"type":"message","id":"5b791d31","parentId":"2a550f18","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:32:10.936Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_sIw5aIu7gmgqJuDfw8pX7033","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    close_result = None\n    margin_replenished = False  # 2026-06-03：-4164 保证金不足时只补一次\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                sym_usdt = f\"{symbol}USDT\"\n                \n                # 🔧 2026-06-03：第一次用 reduceOnly；如果被拒（-2022）则降级不带 reduceOnly\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=sym_usdt,\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,\n                    reduce_only=(attempt == 0),\n                    price=current_price,\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                \n                if close_result.get('success', True):\n                    break\n                \n                order_code = close_result.get('order', {}).get('code', 0)\n                \n                # 降级1：reduceOnly 被拒 → 不带 reduceOnly\n                if attempt == 0 and order_code == -2022:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} reduceOnly 被币安拒（-2022），降级为普通平仓\")\n                    time.sleep(1)\n                    close_result = place_order(\n                        symbol=sym_usdt, side=side, quantity=qty,\n                        leverage=10, reduce_only=False, price=current_price,\n                    )\n                    log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果（降级）：{close_result}\")\n                    if close_result.get('success', True):\n                        break\n                    order_code = close_result.get('order', {}).get('code', 0)\n                \n                # 降级2：保证金不足 → 补充逐仓保证金后重试\n                if order_code == -4164 and not margin_replenished:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 保证金不足（-4164），补充 5 USDT 到逐仓钱包\")\n                    try:\n                        request(\"POST\", \"/fapi/v1/positionMargin\", {\n                            \"symbol\": sym_usdt, \"amount\": 5.0, \"type\": 1\n                        })\n                        margin_replenished = True\n                        time.sleep(1)\n                        close_result = place_order(\n                            symbol=sym_usdt, side=side, quantity=qty,\n                            leverage=10, reduce_only=False, price=current_price,\n                        )\n                        log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果（补保证金后）：{close_result}\")\n                        if close_result.get('success', True):\n                            break\n                    except Exception as me:\n                        log.error(f\"❌ 补充保证金失败：{me}\")\n                \n                log.warning(f\"⚠️ 平仓第{attempt+1}次失败，{'重试' if attempt < 4 else '放弃'}\")\n                if attempt < 4:\n                    time.sleep(2)\n            except Exception as e:\n\n[1360 more lines in file. Use offset=1270 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780457530868}}
{"type":"message","id":"d0afc28a","parentId":"5b791d31","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:32:49.509Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me add the position padding fallback. The logic:\n1. When -4164 still persists after margin replenishment (or -4164 with notional clearly the issue)\n2. Check if notional < 20: qty * current_price < 20\n3. If so, pad: buy enough to reach 20 notional → then close\n\nI need to be careful: the margin replenishment might already have run and maxed out the attempts. Let me add the padding fallback as a THIRD fallback step, right after the margin replenishment.\n\nActually, I should refactor the logic to be cleaner:\n\n1. attempt 0: reduceOnly=true\n2. If -2022: try non-reduceOnly\n3. If -4164: \n   a. Try margin replenishment (one time)\n   b. If -4164 still persists AND notional < 20: pad position (one time)\n4. Otherwise: retry\n\nLet me update the code.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_WAmpfnaACZiJu5gjLxph7730","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","new_string":"    close_result = None\n    margin_replenished = False  # 2026-06-03：-4164 保证金不足时只补一次\n    position_padded = False     # 2026-06-03：名义价值 < $20 时只补一次\n    if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED and size_ratio > 0:\n        for attempt in range(5):\n            try:\n                side = \"SELL\" if typ == \"LONG\" else \"BUY\"\n                sym_usdt = f\"{symbol}USDT\"\n                \n                # 🔧 2026-06-03：第一次用 reduceOnly；如果被拒（-2022）则降级不带 reduceOnly\n                close_result = place_order(\n                    symbol=sym_usdt,\n                    side=side,\n                    quantity=qty,\n                    leverage=10,\n                    reduce_only=(attempt == 0),\n                    price=current_price,\n                )\n                log.info(f\"📝 平仓结果：{close_result}\")\n                \n                if close_result.get