test partially filled the position. Let me check: in the third from last test, I did `SELL 0.008 LIMIT reduceOnly=true` which got -2022 (rejected). Then `BUY 0.003` got -4164 (rejected). So no actual fills happened.\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the `BUY 0.011` might have unexpectedly cleared the position. Wait no, BUY on a LONG position should ADD to it...\n\nI think there might be a bug in the test or the testnet is behaving weirdly. But the important thing is: ETH is now at 0.0!\n\nLet me verify by checking all positions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"ETH 平掉了 ✅"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_zwhGEz1Chzn34or3DXZP1116","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 query_positions.py 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":868,"output":1406,"cacheRead":106368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":108642,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780457669909}}
