{"type":"message","id":"fb82f790","parentId":"c355223e","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:35:38.958Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All done. Let me summarize everything for 老公.\n\nAll 4 positions are now closed (0持仓). The code changes are all syntax-verified. Let me give a final summary.\n\nChanges made today:\n\n1. `calc_tp_sl()` — ATR动态止损\n2. SL触发后API验证 → 失败恢复本地\n3. `sync_stop_loss_to_binance` + `submit_initial_algo_orders` — 精准替换\n4. `close_position` — 三级降级平仓链：\n   - reduceOnly → -2022 → 不带 reduceOnly\n   - 不带 reduceOnly → -4164 → 补保证金\n   - 补保证金后仍 -4164 + 名义< $20 → 买入撑大 → 全平\n\n5. ETH已被手动平掉，当前0持仓。\n\n老公已经知道需要kj重启。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定了 👑\n\n**总结今天改了什么：**\n\n`close_position` 现在有三层降级：\n\n| 层级 | 触发 | 动作 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 1 | reduceOnly → -2022 | 降级不带 reduceOnly |\n| 2 | -4164（保证金） | 补 5 USDT 到逐仓钱包 |\n| 3 | -4164 + 名义 < $20 | 买入 $20 名义价值撑大 → 全平 |\n\n连同之前的 ATR 止损、SL 恢复缓存、精准替换，一共 **5 处改动**，全部语法验证通过。\n\nETH 刚手动平掉了，现在 0 持仓。你下次运行前跑个 `kj` 重启就行 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":170,"output":539,"cacheRead":107008,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107717,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780457730336}}
