{"type":"message","id":"fa48e4ec","parentId":"918aeeb9","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:51:42.757Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both tests returned code=0. I just sent 3 test cards:\n1. \"👑 测试行情\" (with fields/div format)\n2. \"🧪 极简测试\" (with simple div + hr + note)\n3. \"🧪 kv_block 测试\" (with kv_block format)\n\nIf 老公 can see these 3 cards, the format is fine. If he can't see them, there's a deeper issue.\n\nBut wait, 老公 might not have seen them yet. He said the previous two pushes were blank. Let me tell him I just sent 3 test cards and ask which ones he sees.\n\nActually, I should be more careful. Maybe the issue is that the all the cards ARE visible, but the price cards he received earlier had \"ALL: 不在监控列表\" as the MAIN content (visible), but the actual price list that was supposed to be there was missing because ALL is not a valid symbol. So the card said \"未找到任何匹配币种\" and老公 interpreted that as \"空白\".\n\nLet me re-read the code:\n```python\nif not found:\n    elements.append(md(\"⚠️ **未找到任何匹配币种**\"))\n```\n\nSo when ALL was passed, it couldn't find ALL in prices (because ALL is not a coin symbol), so found was empty, and the card showed \"⚠️ 未找到任何匹配币种\". That's not technically \"空白\", but to 老公 it looked like there were no coin prices - just an error message.\n\nBut then the second push with the correct symbols should have worked. Let me check if maybe the second push had timing issues or something.\n\nActually, I think the most productive thing is to ask 老公 to check the 3 test cards I just sent. Two of them clearly show prices. If he can see them, the format is fine and the issue was just the ALL parameter.\n\nLet me tell him I sent 3 test cards.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"刚推了 3 张测试卡片到群里，你看下能收到几张：\n- 🧪 极简测试（纯文本格式）\n- 🧪 kv_block 测试（kv_block 格式）\n- 👑 测试行情（fields 格式，和 query_price 一样）\n\n三张 API 都返回 code=0（成功送达）。如果只能看到部分，说明是某个卡片格式飞书解析有问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepsee