{"type":"message","id":"dba9d08a","parentId":"d1953214","timestamp":"2026-06-03T05:13:11.354Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问 ETH 为什么只有 1.48 USDT 保证金。ETH 持仓 0.008 ETH，入场 $1859，名义价值 = 0.008 × 1859 = $14.87。10x 杠杆，保证金应该是 $14.87 / 10 = $1.49 USDT。\n\n但之前 monitor 开了新的 ETH 仓位，风控标准是 0.108 ETH，但实际 Binance 上只有 0.008 ETH。这就是问题——positionAmt 很小，所以保证金也小。\n\n让我查一下 Binance 上 ETH 的实际仓位数据和保证金。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_pXJkQYbVsg9cqs6JDN2v9326","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\n\n# Get ETH position details\nr = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\nif r and isinstance(r, list):\n    p = r[0]\n    for k in ['symbol','positionAmt','entryPrice','markPrice','unRealizedProfit',\n              'isolatedWallet','isolatedMargin','marginType','leverage',\n              'liquidationPrice','notional','positionSide']:\n        print(f'{k}: {p.get(k)}')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":315,"output":471,"cacheRead":64768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65554,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780463582858}}
