{"type":"message","id":"574d4084","parentId":"baed4eb6","timestamp":"2026-06-03T05:13:53.960Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公说补，就是要把 ETH 仓位补到标准 0.108 ETH。目前有 0.008 ETH，需要再买 0.100 ETH。\n\n但是 ETH 有名义价值 $20 的限制，0.100 × $1872 = $187.2 > $20，没问题。\n\n直接加仓 0.100 ETH。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_HQp8r4q8MfyxZ4DbOqpa3048","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys, time\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nfrom binance_auto_trade import request\n\n# Check current position\nr = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\namt = float(r[0]['positionAmt']) if isinstance(r, list) else 0\ntarget = 0.108\npad = target - amt\nprint(f'当前: {amt} ETH → 需要加 {pad:.3f} ETH')\n\nif pad > 0:\n    r = request('POST', '/fapi/v1/order', {\n        'symbol': 'ETHUSDT', 'side': 'BUY', 'type': 'MARKET',\n        'quantity': pad\n    })\n    time.sleep(1.5)\n    r = request('GET', '/fapi/v2/positionRisk', {'symbol': 'ETHUSDT'})\n    amt2 = float(r[0]['positionAmt']) if isinstance(r, list) else 0\n    print(f'补仓后: {amt2} ETH')\n    print(f'入口价: {r[0][\\\"entryPrice\\\"]}')\n    print(f'保证金: {r[0][\\\"isolatedMargin\\\"]}')\nelse:\n    print('已达到标准仓位')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":298,"output":504,"cacheRead":66304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67106,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780463625663}}
