{"type":"message","id":"2782a80f","parentId":"a5874553","timestamp":"2026-06-03T08:27:40.355Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So all coins have very low scores:\n\nBTC: 10分, ETH: 10分, SOL: 10分, BNB: 10分, DOT: 30分, LINK: 10分, XRP: 10分\n\nThe highest score is DOT at 30分, but the threshold is:\n- Trending: ≥70\n- Ranging: ≥30\n- Volatile: ≥90\n\nDOT at 30分 would barely qualify in Ranging mode if it were exactly 30 and the market state is Ranging. But all signals say NONE, meaning the scores are below threshold.\n\nThe issue: RSI is very high for most coins (SOL 80, XRP 81, LINK 79, ETH 76, DOT 78) indicating overbought territory, and 24h change is all negative (-4% to -5% for most). This means:\n- High RSI (>65) → scoring for SHORT\n- But 24h down (-5%) → scoring for LONG (dip buy)\n- These contradict each other, resulting in very low composite scores\n\nAlso, MA60 is ALL ✗ (price below MA60 for all), which scores for SHORT. But combined with the huge 24h drops, the system is confused.\n\nLet me also check if DOT triggered AI (we saw earlier DOT had AI trigger at 85分 but was rejected due to \"震荡\" market).","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"所有币评分都压得很低：\n\n```\nBTC  10分   RSI:68   24h:-4.2%   NONE\nETH  10分   RSI:76   24h:-5.3%   NONE\nSOL  10分   RSI:80   24h:-5.6%   NONE\nBNB  10分   RSI:64   24h:-5.5%   NONE\nDOT  30分   RSI:78   24h:-1.4%   NONE\nLINK 10分   RSI:79   24h:-3.4%   NONE\nXRP  10分   RSI:81   24h:-1.9%   NONE\n```\n\nDOT 最高 30 分也只刚好摸到震荡市门槛（≥30），而且之前几次 AI 都判\"震荡观望\"拒掉了。\n\n问题在于：RSI 全线超买（70-80+）→ 打分偏空，但 24h 跌了 4-5% → 打分偏多，两边打架把分拉低了。加上价格全在 MA60 下方，信号系统等于在说\"市场没方向，别动\"。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":370,"output":861,"cacheRead":68864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70095,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780475248358}}
