{"type":"message","id":"510cb194","parentId":"30cd882c","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:37:32.987Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_2PZv1W558mvDOefN8ZER1122","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"def log(msg):\n    timestamp = datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8))).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    with open(LOG_FILE, 'a') as f:\n        f.write(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\\n\")\n    print(f\"[{timestamp}] {msg}\")\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取飞书 token\"\"\"\n    if TOKEN_FILE.exists():\n        try:\n            with open(TOKEN_FILE) as f:\n                data = json.load(f)\n            expire = data.get(\"expire\", 0)\n            if time.time() < expire - 300:\n                return data.get(\"token\")\n        except:\n            pass\n    \n    try:\n        resp = requests.post(\n            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n            json={\"app_id\": FEISHU_APP_ID, \"app_secret\": FEISHU_APP_SECRET},\n            timeout=10\n        )\n        data = resp.json()\n        token = data.get(\"tenant_access_token\")\n        expire = int(data.get(\"expire\", 7200))\n        \n        with open(TOKEN_FILE, 'w') as f:\n            json.dump({\"token\": token, \"expire\": time.time() + expire}, f)\n        \n        return token\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"⚠️ 获取飞书 Token 失败: {e}\")\n        raise\n\ndef send_message(text):\n    \"\"\"发送飞书消息\"\"\"\n    try:\n        token = get_token()\n        resp = requests.post(\n            \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=open_id\",\n            headers={\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"},\n            json={\n                \"receive_id\": CHAT_ID,\n                \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n                \"content\": json.dumps({\"text\": text})\n            },\n            timeout=10\n        )\n        data = resp.json()\n        if data.get(\"code\") == 0:\n            log(f\"✅ 推送成功: {text[:30]}...\")\n            return True\n        else:\n            log(f\"❌ 推送失败: {data.get('msg')}\")\n            return False\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"❌ 推送异常: {e}\")\n        return False\n\ndef get_weather():\n    \"\"\"查询东莞天气\"\"\"\n    try:\n        import subprocess\n        result = subprocess.run(\n            [\"curl\", \"-s\", f\"wttr.in/{WEATHER_CITY}?format=%c+%t+(体感%f)+%w+湿度%h\"],\n            capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=10\n        )\n        if result.returncode == 0 and result.stdout.strip():\n            return result.stdout.strip()\n    except Exception as e:\n        log(f\"⚠️ 天气查询失败: {e}\")\n    return None\n\ndef get_bj_time():\n    return datetime.now(timezone.utc).astimezone(timezone(timedelta(hours=8)))\n\ndef main():\n    log(\"🚀 作息提醒调度器启动\")\n\n[44 more lines in file. Use offset=160 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780504652975}}
{"type":"message","id":"83b0ab0f","parentId":"510cb194","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:37:38.068Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the issue. The `requests.post()` calls in `get_token()` and `send_message()` don't use proxies. I need to add:\n\n```python\nproxies={\"http\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\", \"https\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"}\n```\n\nLet me also check the main loop to see if there's a retry/error recovery mechanism.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_VBJoPTLoLzg3RFXwNiyU3133","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py","limit":50,"offset":160}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":782,"output":278,"cacheRead":83968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":85028,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780504652995}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a5009a8","parentId":"83b0ab0f","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:37:38.151Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_VBJoPTLoLzg3RFXwNiyU3133","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    sent_today = set()\n    import random\n    \n    # 每天每种任务随机选一条话术（同一天同一任务固定）\n    daily_msgs = {}  # type -> message\n    \n    while True:\n        now = get_bj_time()\n        date_key = now.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")\n        current_minutes = now.hour * 60 + now.minute\n        \n        # 每天凌晨重置话术\n        if now.hour == 0 and now.minute < 1:\n            daily_msgs.clear()\n            sent_today = {k for k in sent_today if k.startswith(date_key)}\n        \n        for hour, minute, task_type in SCHEDULE:\n            task_key = f\"{date_key}_{hour}_{minute}\"\n            task_minutes = hour * 60 + minute\n            \n            if task_key not in sent_today and abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0:\n                log(f\"🔔 触发任务: {hour:02d}:{minute:02d} ({task_type})\")\n                \n                # 随机选话术（当天同任务保持一致）\n                if task_type not in daily_msgs:\n                    daily_msgs[task_type] = random.choice(MESSAGES[task_type])\n                \n                msg = daily_msgs[task_type]\n                \n                # 起床 + 跑步加天气\n                if task_type in (\"wake\", \"run\"):\n                    weather = get_weather()\n                    weather_line = f\"\\n东莞天气：{weather}\" if weather else \"\"\n                    msg = f\"{msg}\\n{weather_line}\" if weather_line else msg\n                \n                if send_message(msg):\n                    sent_today.add(task_key)\n\n        \n        time.sleep(30)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780504658133}}
{"type":"message","id":"676e972a","parentId":"2a5009a8","timestamp":"2026-06-03T16:37:56.589Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The main loop is simple — it checks tasks every 30 seconds and sends messages. But the issue is:\n\n1. `get_token()` raises an exception on failure, which then propagates to `send_message()` which catches it and logs \"❌ 推送异常\"\n2. But `get_token()` itself has the `try/except` that logs and `raise`s — meaning the exception propagates up\n3. `send_message` catches the exception and returns False, but the main loop continues\n\nWait, actually `get_token()` catches and re-raises. `send_message()` calls `get_token()` in a try block, catches and logs. The main loop then just continues without `sent_today.add(task_key)`, so it would retry on the next 30-second tick. But wait — the condition `abs(current_minutes - task_minutes) <= 0` means it needs exact minute match. At 23:51, the current minutes is 23*60+51 = 1431, and task minutes is 23*60+50 = 1430. The diff is 1, which is > 0, so the condition fails. The task skips and never retries.\n\nSo when the task fails at 23:50 (exact minute match), by 23:51 the condition no longer matches, and the task is lost forever. The task sent_today is never set, so the next tick at 23:50:30 might retry (since current_minutes = 1430 and task_minutes = 1430, diff = 0), but by 23:50:55 it already missed.\n\nActually wait — the scheduler does a 30-second sleep. Let me re-think:\n\n23:50:00 → now = 23:50:00, current_minutes = 1430, task_minutes = 1430, diff = 0 → triggered, failed\n23:50:25 → logged failure\n23:50:30 → next iteration, current_minutes = 1430, task_key NOT in sent_today → triggered again, failed again at 23:50:59\n23:51:00 → current_minutes = 1431, diff = 1 → no match, skipped\n\nSo it had 2 chances (at 23:50:00 and 23:50:30), both failed due to SSL. Then at 23:51, the window closed.\n\nThe fix is simple: add `proxies` to the requests calls. Let me add proxy support.\n\nI should add proxies to:\n1. `get_token()` — `requests.post(url, json=..., timeout=10, proxies=PROXIES)`\n2. `send_message()` — `requests.post(url, headers=..., json=..., timeout=10, proxies=PROXIES)`\n3. `get_weather()` — uses subprocess curl which might also need proxy... but actually it uses `curl wttr.in` which is a simple HTTP call that might also be blocked. But let me focus on the main issue first.\n\nLet me add:\n```python\nPROXIES = {\"http\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\", \"https\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"}\n```\n\nAnd add `proxies=PROXIES` to both requests calls.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_BVmjZkoq16YQIgNtz1XT5410","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/reminder_scheduler.py","old_string":"LOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\nWEATHER_CITY = \"Dongguan\"","new_string":"PROXIES = {\"http\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\", \"https\": \"http://127.0.0.1:7890\"}\nLOG_FILE = Path(\"/root/.openclaw/logs/scheduler.log\")\nTOKEN_FILE = Path(\"/tmp/feishu_reminder_token.json\")\nWEATHER_CITY = \"Dongguan\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":459,"output":1630,"cacheRead":84864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86953,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780504658162}}
